    "passed-check-can-ask-the-host": [
      "Cause confirmed - a run of this repository showed its token without actions read and the lookup still working, so a public repository is spared and a private one is not",
      "The next release is breaking - a project whose calling workflow withholds a permission has a pipeline that does not start until it grants it; the release notes open with a required by-hand step, pipeline.mjs permissions",
      "Only the jobs that ask the host declare permissions, so a project's own stage scripts keep what their token had",
      "Shipped with the last criterion's manual check pending in the verification log, so the three other plans on the same file were not held until a release; a failed check becomes a new backlog item",
      "Executor was a Sonnet subagent; one mechanical defect fixed in review and declared - a refusal on one of the lookup's requests gave no warning; decision recorded as FW-077, amending FW-048"
